         "fourteen_days": "The figure shows the prognosis for the 7-day interval between 05/27/2026 and 06/02/2026, forecast of precipitation deficit (orange) concentrated in the eastern part of the monitored region, over the basins of the Abacaxis, Aripuanã, Curuá Una, Iriri, Ji-Paraná, Marañon, Tapajós, Teles Pires, and Xingu rivers. Forecast of positive precipitation anomalies (blue) over the Coari and Tefé river basins. Rainfall close to climatological norms (white) is forecast for the remaining monitored basins."
